Open Brain NW0 experimental Graphify Markdown helper

Modified by Open Brain contributors in September 2026 from Graphify 0.9.57.
Changes make extractor exports lazy, separate pure metadata and discovery rules,
and use a bounded Markdown parser against a caller-selected snapshot root.
These modifications are a maintained experimental patch, not an upstream release.

The accompanying LICENSE, LICENSE-MIT, and NOTICE preserve Graphify's licensing
and attribution. Other dependency notices are included as distribution metadata
inside the frozen executable. Proof source and patch manifest are available in
the tools/nw0_graphify_probe directory of the Open Brain repository.
